  (text_box "BHI CLUSTER (spec 4.4): BMP390L/BMM150/BME688 are sub-sensors on BHI M1 master port - exact M1/M2/M3 wiring = COPY\nABX00050 (Nicla) at capture (TBD-JP). BME688 DNP per OD-6 (footprint retained). H-IF SPI 16 MHz (app.overlay) on\nP0.03-05 despite Table 4 low-freq remark - risk R1: drop to 8/4 MHz if RF regressions. RESETN -> P0.13 (moved, C3/OD-7).\nHOSTBOOT(3) NC v1 (TBD-JP vs Nicla); VREG(6) NC v1 (decoupling per Bosch ds - TBD-JP, not in spec 6); RESV1-3 NC (do not connect)."
    (at 282 100 0) (size 122 22)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid f34cc54b-38b9-4931-9a93-604e42c3c5ca)
  )
  (text_box "LED (spec 4.3): U5 VCC/SDB -> V_PMID (OD-17: confirm SDB net on ABX00050 at capture); decap value TBD-JP.\nIS31 OUT1-3 are current sinks - verify SMLP34RGB2W3 common polarity at capture (spec text says anodes to OUTs)."
    (at 352 148 0) (size 48 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 8c06e017-b961-462f-891c-0a02c5416bd3)
  )
  (text_box "F41 LED STATUS = TEMPORAL ENCODING (JP 2026-11-22). Rhythm is the PRIMARY cue, colour secondary:\na blinking LED is identifiable in direct sun and at 5 m where a steady hue is not.\n  ARMED      : ORANGE 1 Hz, 50 % duty (500 ms on / 500 ms off)\n  SLEEP      : BLUE 100 ms pulse every 2 s (5 %)\n  advertising: BLUE 0.5 Hz\n  connected  : GREEN slow breathe\n  calib >=2  : GREEN double-flash\n  uncalib    : BLUE slow flow\n  LOGGING    : RED 4 Hz\n  low bat/err: YELLOW 8 Hz\nImplement with a per-state (period, duty) table; reset the pattern phase on state change so a\nmid-off glance cannot be misread as idle. Non-blocking: LED renders via sysworkq, never in ISR."
    (at 150 200 0) (size 100 34)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 1fa562da-8731-42e7-a2a3-87e49a582e78)
  )

